  m_text: "Stonicorn\r\n\r\na game by shieldgenerator7\r\n\r\n=== Cast ===\r\n\r\nMerky:
    shieldgenerator7 (sound effects)\r\nIo the Moonicorn: Jenna Daniels\r\nKaki the
    Cacticorn: Rain of Fire 22\r\nKelpie the Inflaticorn: LexsRose\r\nYellow the
    Arboricorn: shieldgenerator7\r\nTransistor the Metalcorn: Centaurus\r\nNimbus
    the Cloudicorn: legomike5\r\nMayor Grunhardt the Goldicorn: anonymous\r\n\r\n===
    Development ===\r\n\r\nProgramming:\r\nshieldgenerator7\r\nSaladDean\r\n\r\nArt:\r\nSiMonk0\r\nshieldgenerator7\r\nMixup\r\n\r\nMusic:\r\n4everfreebrony\r\nDARK
    FANTASY STUDIO\r\n\r\nWebsite:\r\nSiMonk0\r\nCharlie MuffyDerp\r\n\r\n=== Support
    ===\r\n\r\nTesting: \r\nEveryone at COGG\r\nJenna Daniels\r\nKevin Holstein\r\nCharles
    Dickens\r\nPhanxgames\r\nMyDogHas45\r\n\r\nEmotional Support:\r\nshieldgenerator7's
    Mom\r\nJenna Daniels\r\nPhanxgames\r\n\r\nGenerous People:\r\nshieldgenerator7's
    Parents\r\nVindahood\r\nPhanxgames\r\n\r\nGDEX Exhibit Help:\r\nTodd Barchok\r\nMiss
    Saylor\r\nGinpeporimeg\r\nshieldgenerator7's Mom\r\n\r\nSpecial Thanks:\r\nCOGG\r\nNew
    Leaf\r\n\r\nThanks to everyone who watched my livestreams and tried out my game!"
